# SplitSmart Design System

> Extracted from UI screenshots. All tokens live in [tailwind.config.js](file:///d:/STUDY/SplitSmart/client/tailwind.config.js) and reusable classes in [index.css](file:///d:/STUDY/SplitSmart/client/src/index.css) `@layer components`.

---

## 1. Colors

| Token              | Value                          | Usage                   |
|--------------------|--------------------------------|-------------------------|
| `--bg-base`        | `#0a0f0d`                      | Page background         |
| `--bg-surface`     | `#111a15`                      | Modals, sidebar         |
| `--bg-card`        | `#141f18`                      | Cards, panels           |
| `--bg-card-hover`  | `#192a1f`                      | Hovered cards           |
| `--bg-input`       | `#1a2b20`                      | Form inputs             |
| `--accent-green`   | `#00ff88`                      | Primary CTA, success    |
| `--accent-coral`   | `#ff6b6b`                      | Danger, "you owe"       |
| `--accent-purple`  | `#7c5cff`                      | Category badges         |
| `--text-primary`   | `#ffffff`                      | Headings, body          |
| `--text-muted`     | `#7a9485`                      | Secondary text          |
| `--text-dim`       | `#4a6355`                      | Disabled/placeholder    |
| `--border-subtle`  | `rgba(255,255,255,0.06)`       | Dividers, input border  |
| `--border-card`    | `rgba(255,255,255,0.07)`       | Card border             |
| `--border-hover`   | `rgba(255,255,255,0.12)`       | Card hover border       |

---

## 2. Typography

| Style     | Font      | Size  | Weight | Tracking | Usage                 |
|-----------|-----------|-------|--------|----------|-----------------------|
| Display   | Syne      | 48px  | 800    | —        | Hero text, big totals |
| H1        | Syne      | 32px  | 700    | —        | Page titles           |
| H2        | Syne      | 24px  | 700    | —        | Section headings      |
| H3        | Syne      | 20px  | 700    | —        | Modal titles          |
| H4        | Syne      | 18px  | 700    | —        | Card titles           |
| Body      | DM Sans   | 14px  | 400    | —        | Paragraph text        |
| Small     | DM Sans   | 13px  | 400    | —        | Descriptions          |
| XS        | DM Sans   | 12px  | 400    | —        | Metadata, counts      |
| Label     | DM Sans   | 11px  | 500    | 0.12em   | Section labels        |
| Micro     | DM Sans   | 10px  | 400    | 0.1em    | Table headers, badges |

---

## 3. Component Classes

### Cards
```html
<!-- Interactive card (hover lift) -->
<div class="card">...</div>

<!-- Static panel (no hover) -->
<div class="card-flat">...</div>

<!-- Dashboard summary banner -->
<div class="card-summary">...</div>
```

### Buttons
```html
<!-- Primary (green glow) -->
<button class="btn-primary">+ New Expense</button>

<!-- Secondary (outline) -->
<button class="btn-secondary">Settle Up</button>

<!-- Danger (coral outline → filled on hover) -->
<button class="btn-danger">Delete Group</button>

<!-- Ghost (subtle border) -->
<button class="btn-ghost">+ Add Member</button>
```

### Inputs
```html
<input class="input" placeholder="Description" />
<!-- Focus: green border + glow ring -->
```

### Modals
```html
<div class="modal-overlay">
  <div class="modal-content">
    <h2 class="modal-title">Add Expense</h2>
    <!-- content -->
  </div>
</div>
```

### Sidebar
```html
<aside class="sidebar">
  <a class="sidebar-link-active">Home</a>
  <a class="sidebar-link">Groups</a>
</aside>
```

### Navbar
```html
<nav class="navbar">...</nav>
```

### Table Rows
```html
<div class="table-row">...</div>
```

### Badges
```html
<span class="badge badge-active">ACTIVE</span>
<span class="badge badge-settled">SETTLED</span>
```

### Toasts
```html
<div class="toast toast-success">Expense added!</div>
<div class="toast toast-error">Failed to load</div>
```

### Labels
```html
<p class="label">Total Spent</p>
```

---

## 4. Spacing

| Context            | Value    | Tailwind       |
|--------------------|----------|----------------|
| Page padding X     | 24px     | `px-6`         |
| Page padding Y     | 40px     | `py-10`        |
| Card padding       | 24px     | `p-6`          |
| Card padding (lg)  | 28px     | `p-7`          |
| Modal padding      | 32px     | `p-8`          |
| Grid gap (cards)   | 20px     | `gap-5`        |
| Section gap        | 32px     | `gap-8`        |
| Max content width  | 1100px   | `max-w-[1100px]` |

---

## 5. Shadows

| Name              | Value                                    | Usage             |
|-------------------|------------------------------------------|-------------------|
| `shadow-glow`     | `0 0 20px rgba(0,255,136,0.25)`          | Primary buttons   |
| `shadow-glow-strong` | `0 0 30px rgba(0,255,136,0.45)`       | Button hover      |
| `shadow-card-hover`  | `0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)`          | Card lift         |
| `shadow-modal`    | `0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)`           | Modal backdrop    |
| `shadow-summary`  | `0 10px 40px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)`     | Summary banner    |

---

## 6. Animations

| Class         | Keyframes       | Duration | Usage          |
|---------------|-----------------|----------|----------------|
| `.page-enter` | `pageEnter`     | 300ms    | Page transitions |
| (modal)       | `modalSlideUp`  | 250ms    | Modal open     |
| `.toast`      | `toastIn`       | 300ms    | Toast slide-in |

---

## 7. Border Radii

| Element  | Radius  |
|----------|---------|
| Cards    | 18px    |
| Modals   | 20px    |
| Buttons  | 12px    |
| Inputs   | 12px    |
| Logo     | 10px    |
| Avatars  | 9999px  |
